WEBVTT

00:00:01.304 --> 00:00:03.844
Everyone in front of your
televisions, did you know this?

00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:06.404
The number of espers is
increasing in the 21st century.

00:00:07.944 --> 00:00:11.714
But even now, society is still dominated
by the Normals who outnumber us!

00:00:12.114 --> 00:00:16.384
We espers aren't free to use our
fantastic powers as we wish!

00:00:17.494 --> 00:00:19.094
That's just wrong!

00:00:19.094 --> 00:00:21.584
Why should superior humans
be controlled by Normals?!

00:00:22.894 --> 00:00:25.054
That's why you should join PANDRA today!

00:00:25.394 --> 00:00:28.124
Bright smiles! Nice friends!

00:00:28.204 --> 00:00:31.874
Beaches with clear, blue water and
rich days of thrills await you!

00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:35.404
Join today and get this limited-edition cell
phone strap to mark the occasion!

00:00:35.404 --> 00:00:37.674
If you're a clever person, PANDRA's for you.

00:00:37.674 --> 00:00:39.904
Make the decision! Make it PANDRA!

00:00:41.044 --> 00:00:43.484
Secrecy will be maintained,
no membership fee will be charged.

00:00:43.484 --> 00:00:45.884
I'll be waiting for you to join us!

00:00:46.384 --> 00:00:48.214
Is it going? Is it going?!

00:00:48.554 --> 00:00:51.044
It's gone! Home run!

00:00:53.064 --> 00:00:54.614
Damn those PANDRA scoundrels!

00:00:54.894 --> 00:00:57.124
Another one of their stupid signaljacks!

00:00:57.294 --> 00:01:00.794
Why can't we jam it or find
the transmission source?!

00:01:01.204 --> 00:01:02.234
I don't know!

00:01:02.234 --> 00:01:04.804
You don't know?! Well, think harder!

00:01:04.804 --> 00:01:06.744
Even if you say that!

00:01:06.744 --> 00:01:10.074
Chief, BABEL is being flooded
with viewer complaints!

00:01:10.444 --> 00:01:14.884
Yes. Yes. I'm terribly sorry.
I promise, it won't happen again.

00:01:14.944 --> 00:01:17.184
Yes. Yes. I'm very sorry.

00:01:17.184 --> 00:01:18.584
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:01:18.654 --> 00:01:21.384
Mercy, please!
Yes, I see. Yes!

00:01:21.384 --> 00:01:22.214
Yes.

00:01:22.554 --> 00:01:26.024
But how is that commercial
going to get people to join up?

00:01:26.024 --> 00:01:32.404
True. It gives no way to contact them.
Which means that PANDRA...

00:01:32.404 --> 00:01:34.634
I get it! They don't need to be contacted!

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:39.064
They'll get sympathetic espers on their
side, even without recruiting them.

00:01:39.604 --> 00:01:41.334
So, their objective...

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:45.474
is the broadcast of the commercial itself, isn't it?

00:01:47.684 --> 00:01:54.784
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:55.624 --> 00:02:01.494
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:09.734
Meeting you like I did

00:02:10.074 --> 00:02:14.944
Wasn't just so we could live

00:02:16.214 --> 00:02:21.734
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:02:22.144 --> 00:02:26.744
And surely change the future

00:02:27.354 --> 00:02:30.254
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:02:30.254 --> 00:02:33.384
Is released (changing yourself)

00:02:33.524 --> 00:02:39.264
An angel's shining surges through me

00:02:40.704 --> 00:02:43.274
The "wings" that will save the world

00:02:43.274 --> 00:02:46.104
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:02:46.344 --> 00:02:52.504
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:02:52.644 --> 00:02:55.444
The power given to me

00:02:55.444 --> 00:02:58.084
Spurs me into the sky

00:02:58.084 --> 00:03:03.814
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:03:04.124 --> 00:03:09.684
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:03:18.704 --> 00:03:18.874
27th sense: "Declaration of War!
A Challenge From PANDRA"

00:03:18.874 --> 00:03:21.734
You must be pleased with last night's broadcast.

00:03:21.904 --> 00:03:24.444
Yes. The major was very pleased with it, as well.

00:03:24.444 --> 00:03:27.444
I'm honored. Please give him my regards.

00:03:27.444 --> 00:03:28.884
Tell him "hi"!

00:03:28.884 --> 00:03:32.584
Just beware of BABEL's movements.
They'll be getting serious now.

00:03:32.754 --> 00:03:35.484
Oh, spare us! We're professionals!

00:03:35.684 --> 00:03:36.984
Wait, don't be hasty...

00:03:43.594 --> 00:03:45.124
"PANDRA! Another Broadcast Hijack!!"

00:03:45.494 --> 00:03:47.964
You look good on camera, don't you, Magi?

00:03:48.204 --> 00:03:52.134
Yeah, but not as much as I do.
Hey there, sexy old guy!

00:03:52.134 --> 00:03:53.474
Who are you calling old?!

00:03:53.474 --> 00:03:56.374
But now that this has caused such a fuss...

00:03:57.514 --> 00:04:00.844
I won't be surprised if an
old friend makes an appearance.

00:04:01.744 --> 00:04:05.314
Secrets maintained? No membership fee?

00:04:06.624 --> 00:04:08.614
What a showoff!

00:04:08.724 --> 00:04:11.554
I told them I wanted to be left alone to sleep!

00:04:11.554 --> 00:04:11.694
ROKUJOIN ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
I told them I wanted to be left alone to sleep!

00:04:11.694 --> 00:04:12.394
ROKUJOIN ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:04:12.394 --> 00:04:14.924
ROKUJOIN ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
Jeez, what is with this PANDRA thing?

00:04:14.924 --> 00:04:15.064
Jeez, what is with this PANDRA thing?

00:04:15.064 --> 00:04:19.204
Thanks to them, I didn't get to
see that home run get hit!

00:04:19.204 --> 00:04:21.564
That's why I hate espers!

00:04:21.764 --> 00:04:24.294
Don't lump all espers together!

00:04:24.674 --> 00:04:26.904
PANDRA's a criminal gang!

00:04:27.174 --> 00:04:29.314
Yeah! That was hate speech, just now!

00:04:29.314 --> 00:04:32.144
And who cares about some big
loss by the Hanshin Tigers?

00:04:32.144 --> 00:04:34.204
You Giants fans are so full of yourselves!

00:04:34.744 --> 00:04:38.414
Hold it! That's bull! How is what
you said not hate speech, too?!

00:04:38.414 --> 00:04:40.684
Stop it, Tono! Please don't argue!

00:04:41.784 --> 00:04:42.824
Chisato...

00:04:42.824 --> 00:04:46.024
Do you really hate all espers? Even me?

00:04:46.564 --> 00:04:48.684
Akashi, cut it out!

00:04:50.394 --> 00:04:53.524
Tono's biggest weakness is hearing
Chisato sounding sad.

00:04:54.364 --> 00:04:56.634
Akashi! You!

00:04:56.704 --> 00:04:58.234
Come on, start crying now!

00:04:58.234 --> 00:05:00.234
Three! Two! One! Action!

00:05:00.344 --> 00:05:02.464
I can't just cry on cue!

00:05:03.714 --> 00:05:07.404
Oh, but the weapons of women
must always be ready to use.

00:05:07.814 --> 00:05:10.354
It's okay. Just practice and you'll be able to do it.

00:05:10.354 --> 00:05:12.014
S-Sannomiya...

00:05:12.014 --> 00:05:13.884
You've mastered it, I suppose?

00:05:14.254 --> 00:05:15.444
Of course!

00:05:15.584 --> 00:05:19.994
I see. If you can't use tears, then the
only remaining weapon for women is...

00:05:20.864 --> 00:05:22.224
SEX APPEAL!

00:05:25.134 --> 00:05:26.404
Cut it out!

00:05:26.404 --> 00:05:28.004
Akashi, you pervert!

00:05:28.004 --> 00:05:30.804
It wasn't me! It was, um, Nikumaru!

00:05:31.134 --> 00:05:33.664
Still, you two are acting
awfully close, aren't you?

00:05:36.044 --> 00:05:37.944
No! You just!

00:05:38.414 --> 00:05:40.384
Got the wedding date set?

00:05:40.384 --> 00:05:41.904
I said it's not like that!

00:05:41.984 --> 00:05:45.054
Typical Kaoru. She can change
the subject in a second.

00:05:45.054 --> 00:05:46.724
Huh? She planned all that?

00:05:46.724 --> 00:05:48.184
Probably more instinctive.

00:05:48.484 --> 00:05:52.154
Nobody can beat Kaoru at that, boy or girl.

00:05:52.154 --> 00:05:54.424
Right. Or esper or Normal.

00:05:54.424 --> 00:05:56.324
Or PANDRA or us.

00:05:56.534 --> 00:05:59.764
Akashi and the rest are different, somehow.

00:05:59.864 --> 00:06:04.394
I wonder if there's a side to
them they don't show us.

00:06:08.304 --> 00:06:09.704
It's almost time.

00:06:09.844 --> 00:06:13.314
The signaljacks have been happening
every night between 7:00 and 9:00.

00:06:13.314 --> 00:06:15.714
They've been broadcasting that
commercial for a week now.

00:06:16.184 --> 00:06:17.814
Today, we'll catch them.

00:06:17.814 --> 00:06:21.124
The Children are the strongest special
espers we have. You can do it!

00:06:21.124 --> 00:06:23.294
Nice to hear it, Mr. Minamoto!

00:06:23.294 --> 00:06:24.124
Leave it to us!

00:06:25.094 --> 00:06:28.924
Hey, Minamoto... Why's Major Hyobu doing this?

00:06:30.694 --> 00:06:33.234
Did you know, Minamoto? I...

00:06:33.234 --> 00:06:35.034
Kaoru, don't!

00:06:37.234 --> 00:06:40.444
What's wrong, Mr. Minamoto?
You suddenly look so upset.

00:06:40.444 --> 00:06:43.274
Yeah, well... Hyobu's objective is...

00:06:43.744 --> 00:06:46.334
I'm afraid it may be a war
between espers and Normals.

00:06:48.284 --> 00:06:50.684
I think this case is him putting
his pieces into place.

00:06:51.114 --> 00:06:54.824
That man would do anything to split us apart!

00:06:54.824 --> 00:06:57.824
To split us apart?! What do you mean?!

00:06:57.824 --> 00:06:59.624
That's news to me!

00:06:59.964 --> 00:07:03.224
Girls... Don't believe him!

00:07:04.164 --> 00:07:06.704
No, that's not what I meant.

00:07:06.704 --> 00:07:07.704
Kaoru.

00:07:07.704 --> 00:07:10.434
If it's tonight between 7:00 and 9:00...

00:07:10.574 --> 00:07:12.944
That's when they broadcast
"Friday Suspense Theater,

00:07:12.944 --> 00:07:15.974
Mira Ana, Women's Mysteries,
Beautiful High School Girls series 8,

00:07:15.974 --> 00:07:19.584
"The Dark Figures Through the Steam
~ Bathing Beauty Overload!

00:07:19.584 --> 00:07:21.374
"Bloody Love at the Open Air Baths!"

00:07:21.484 --> 00:07:25.944
Why? This is too cruel! Interrupting
those bath scenes is a major disaster!

00:07:26.184 --> 00:07:28.654
Um... Well...

00:07:28.654 --> 00:07:33.294
Don't worry, Kaoru. I anticipated
this and asked the chief to get

00:07:33.294 --> 00:07:36.294
a dub of the pre-broadcast
master from the network.

00:07:36.294 --> 00:07:39.064
Ooh! That's even better quality
than recording it at home!

00:07:39.064 --> 00:07:40.464
Wow! Seriously?!

00:07:43.434 --> 00:07:48.044
Personally, I don't think
Major Hyobu's such a bad guy.

00:07:48.044 --> 00:07:49.714
Doesn't he have a point to what he says?

00:07:49.714 --> 00:07:52.574
You don't care, as long as you
get to watch your TV show?!

00:07:52.574 --> 00:07:56.354
It's okay! I'll let you see the bathing scenes, too!

00:07:56.354 --> 00:07:59.514
No! And I don't want to watch your stupid show!

00:08:00.884 --> 00:08:02.584
You dope. I was kidding.

00:08:06.724 --> 00:08:09.214
After all, you're a Normal, too.

00:08:09.364 --> 00:08:12.794
We don't believe that everyone
who isn't an esper is our enemy.

00:08:13.164 --> 00:08:14.034
Right?

00:08:18.134 --> 00:08:21.674
Teasing adults... These little brats!

00:08:21.674 --> 00:08:24.944
Dammit, Minamoto! What are you doing
in the middle of an operation?!

00:08:25.244 --> 00:08:26.214
He's a lolicon.

00:08:27.244 --> 00:08:29.114
Yeah... A lolicon.

00:08:29.214 --> 00:08:32.114
Do you realize what'll happen if
they get away again tonight?

00:08:32.114 --> 00:08:34.184
Now get The Children on standby!

00:08:34.184 --> 00:08:35.014
Y-Yes, sir!

00:08:36.554 --> 00:08:40.594
Ah... So, if they're sending their
tiger cubs The Children out...

00:08:40.594 --> 00:08:42.924
they must have a chance at victory tonight.

00:08:44.364 --> 00:08:47.534
But we're pros at manipulating
electrical waves and magnetism.

00:08:47.534 --> 00:08:50.604
To say nothing of how a
fine esper organization...

00:08:50.604 --> 00:08:52.094
P-PANDRA!

00:08:52.374 --> 00:08:53.964
is who we work for.

00:08:54.644 --> 00:08:57.434
They won't stop our broadcast, no matter
how many they send after us!

00:08:58.014 --> 00:09:00.844
Big Electro, we're ready to record!

00:09:00.844 --> 00:09:04.574
Excellent! We'll use magnetic control to
manipulate the recording as it's being made.

00:09:06.384 --> 00:09:10.554
Tonight's a very special episode:
the unmasking of The Children!

00:09:10.554 --> 00:09:12.894
Make sure you shoot it well!

00:09:12.894 --> 00:09:15.824
Great plan, big brother! You sure are smart!

00:09:16.434 --> 00:09:18.834
Take this! Super Electro Spark!

00:09:23.074 --> 00:09:23.804
What happened?!

00:09:23.804 --> 00:09:27.374
Dunno! We suddenly lost all readouts
and electrical systems!

00:09:27.374 --> 00:09:29.604
It might have been a powerful
electromagnetic pulse!

00:09:29.914 --> 00:09:30.744
Uh-oh, we're falling.

00:09:31.544 --> 00:09:34.344
The hell we are! The Children, released!

00:09:37.014 --> 00:09:39.214
To protect steamy moods!

00:09:39.214 --> 00:09:41.814
And protect happy get-togethers
with Detective Ochanoma!

00:09:42.284 --> 00:09:44.914
When everyone smiles, the moon smiles, too!

00:09:45.254 --> 00:09:49.054
The Absolutely Lovely Children are on the case!

00:09:50.064 --> 00:09:52.534
This is no time to be casually striking poses!

00:09:55.964 --> 00:09:57.874
Here's how it'll go when they come after us.

00:09:57.874 --> 00:09:59.664
It'll be easy to turn this into
a PR disaster for them!

00:10:00.204 --> 00:10:02.404
On screen graphic:
"Newsbreak! BABEL helicopter...

00:10:02.404 --> 00:10:04.944
"carrying special espers
plunges into city center!"

00:10:04.944 --> 00:10:07.034
Big brother, look!

00:10:12.384 --> 00:10:16.284
PSYCHIC BALANCING TOY!

00:10:19.764 --> 00:10:20.964
That got it.

00:10:20.964 --> 00:10:23.834
No, it didn't! Put it down level!

00:10:23.834 --> 00:10:25.764
They're someplace close by!

00:10:26.664 --> 00:10:29.364
They're recording us from that building there!

00:10:29.364 --> 00:10:30.204
What's?

00:10:30.204 --> 00:10:32.064
Piece of cake, now that we know where they are.

00:10:34.474 --> 00:10:37.734
All right, we've got 'em!
The bath scenes are saved!

00:10:40.914 --> 00:10:41.484
What?

00:10:41.484 --> 00:10:43.144
They vanished. Are they teleporters?

00:10:43.514 --> 00:10:45.114
No, I saw it clearly.

00:10:45.114 --> 00:10:47.454
They're Electrowave Manipulators!

00:10:47.454 --> 00:10:49.624
They used their powers to
create an illusion for us!

00:10:49.624 --> 00:10:51.094
Huh? Electrowaves?

00:10:51.094 --> 00:10:54.664
Yeah. This has been going just as
Oboro and I predicted it would.

00:10:54.664 --> 00:10:57.994
Now what? We can't catch
them if we can't find them.

00:10:58.334 --> 00:10:59.994
HQ is working on that.

00:11:00.404 --> 00:11:02.634
We'll stand by for now till we're contacted.

00:11:02.634 --> 00:11:03.364
Oh, no!

00:11:04.404 --> 00:11:08.064
Here are BABEL's top secret Level 7 espers!

00:11:08.674 --> 00:11:13.084
Children! How shocking!
These wielders of deadly Level 7 power...

00:11:13.084 --> 00:11:16.014
are children who barely know right from wrong!

00:11:16.114 --> 00:11:17.114
Stop them, Minamoto!

00:11:17.114 --> 00:11:19.584
They're trying to use
The Children for propaganda!

00:11:19.954 --> 00:11:23.114
What? We're on TV? Where's the camera?!
Yes, sir! Roger that! We'll find them at once!

00:11:23.524 --> 00:11:25.754
Behind you, Kaoru.

00:11:25.754 --> 00:11:26.454
Here?

00:11:26.694 --> 00:11:29.564
Idiot! Hide your face, Kaoru!
You're all top secret!

00:11:29.634 --> 00:11:32.734
I'm Kaoru Akashi, 10 years old,
and I was born in Tokyo!

00:11:32.734 --> 00:11:35.604
My friends just signed me up for an audition,

00:11:35.604 --> 00:11:39.974
Thanks to my cuteness and talents,
I was accepted as a special esper!

00:11:40.874 --> 00:11:41.974
Stop!

00:11:41.974 --> 00:11:45.004
It's going out live!
Her school friends will see this!

00:11:45.314 --> 00:11:47.644
These wielders of deadly Level 7 power...

00:11:47.744 --> 00:11:50.744
are children who barely know right from wrong!

00:11:51.154 --> 00:11:53.774
Let's try to get a closeup!
That view from behind... Can it be?!

00:11:54.054 --> 00:11:57.724
And here is her face!
What will she say to the camera?!
She... She's turning this way!

00:11:57.724 --> 00:12:02.554
Espers are special beings!
I like to bully Normals!

00:12:04.094 --> 00:12:06.084
I don't know her.

00:12:10.574 --> 00:12:13.004
How can I sleep with this racket?!

00:12:15.974 --> 00:12:18.464
Back off! Why, you! Hey!

00:12:21.384 --> 00:12:22.474
Red chili oil!

00:12:22.584 --> 00:12:23.874
Boiled egg!

00:12:26.214 --> 00:12:28.824
How's this, big brother?

00:12:28.824 --> 00:12:30.724
I like to bully Normals!

00:12:31.554 --> 00:12:34.354
Not bad, but not enough, either.

00:12:34.794 --> 00:12:36.394
We need to broadcast footage of them...

00:12:36.394 --> 00:12:38.764
destroying the city and
endangering ordinary people.

00:12:38.764 --> 00:12:40.394
B-But...

00:12:40.604 --> 00:12:44.594
this will ruin the image of
all espers, not just BABEL!

00:12:45.174 --> 00:12:47.294
That is PANDRA's aim.

00:12:48.104 --> 00:12:49.974
To concentrate the power of all espers.

00:12:50.114 --> 00:12:55.244
To ensure victory in the war with Normals,
both sides must be radicalized!

00:12:55.814 --> 00:12:59.274
Propaganda which spoils our
image will accomplish that.

00:13:02.324 --> 00:13:04.324
The plan seems to especially call for...

00:13:04.324 --> 00:13:06.954
The Children to become
vital members of our group.

00:13:07.424 --> 00:13:11.134
The image of them as the enemies of
Normals will be convenient for us.

00:13:11.134 --> 00:13:14.794
I get it! You really are smart, big brother!

00:13:21.244 --> 00:13:24.644
The TV totally lies! I'm not like that!

00:13:24.644 --> 00:13:26.944
I should be cuter and sexier!

00:13:26.944 --> 00:13:28.914
You sure about the sexy part?

00:13:28.914 --> 00:13:34.024
It's okay. Anyone can see you're the cutest,
sexiest little monster in Japan.

00:13:34.024 --> 00:13:36.494
Don't get worked up over stupid things!

00:13:36.494 --> 00:13:39.394
Still, thank goodness your
identities weren't revealed.

00:13:39.394 --> 00:13:41.984
A young girl's heart can't
separate out stuff like that!

00:13:45.464 --> 00:13:47.764
Hey! What're you lookin' at?!

00:13:48.634 --> 00:13:50.724
Do espers look that weird?

00:13:51.834 --> 00:13:54.004
Wanna taste of our ESP?

00:13:54.004 --> 00:13:57.874
We're special espers! We can do anything!

00:14:04.384 --> 00:14:05.854
Now they're doing it to our lovely images!

00:14:06.214 --> 00:14:07.014
Unforgivable.

00:14:07.224 --> 00:14:09.274
Yeah! I'm with ya, Shiho!

00:14:09.384 --> 00:14:11.494
Just calm down!

00:14:11.494 --> 00:14:13.954
We'll teach those jerks a lesson!
Well? Have you found the enemy espers yet?

00:14:14.194 --> 00:14:16.364
We've almost got them, but...

00:14:16.364 --> 00:14:19.964
We picked up faint electrowave
static similar to psychic waves,

00:14:19.964 --> 00:14:22.364
but there's too many other
types of radio noise in Tokyo.

00:14:22.364 --> 00:14:24.574
I thought having them
concentrate on The Children...

00:14:24.574 --> 00:14:26.434
would open a chink in their defense, but...

00:14:26.504 --> 00:14:29.744
Right. At this rate, they'll
keep us on the defensive.

00:14:29.744 --> 00:14:33.444
As inflexible as ever I see, Kiritsubo.

00:14:37.484 --> 00:14:41.714
If there was only a way to temporarily
stop all radio broadcasts in the city!

00:14:45.754 --> 00:14:47.094
Yes, Chief?

00:14:47.094 --> 00:14:49.124
Yes, hello? Mr. Glasses Guy?

00:14:49.124 --> 00:14:51.994
Look, just cut those power lines where you are.

00:14:52.094 --> 00:14:54.704
Huh? Who the hell is this?!

00:14:54.704 --> 00:14:59.334
That's a super high-voltage power line
with 225,000 volts running through it!

00:14:59.334 --> 00:15:01.344
We'd black out the whole city if we cut that!

00:15:01.344 --> 00:15:04.444
Come on. We're just talking
for 20 to 30 seconds or so.

00:15:04.444 --> 00:15:06.964
It might give you enough time
to find the enemy, right?

00:15:07.644 --> 00:15:09.284
Minamoto, what's wrong?

00:15:09.284 --> 00:15:10.054
True, if we cut the line, we could spot an
enemy putting out electrowave radiation...

00:15:10.054 --> 00:15:12.214
Who's he talking to?
True, if we cut the line, we could spot an
enemy putting out electrowave radiation...

00:15:12.214 --> 00:15:13.114
True, if we cut the line, we could spot an
enemy putting out electrowave radiation...

00:15:13.114 --> 00:15:13.824
But!

00:15:13.824 --> 00:15:17.224
Who cares?! You're playing into
Hyobu's hands if you don't!

00:15:17.224 --> 00:15:18.254
Is that? It can't be!
I don't want that!

00:15:18.254 --> 00:15:19.324
Is that? It can't be!
I'm getting sick of you!

00:15:19.324 --> 00:15:20.694
When did she wake up?
I'm getting sick of you!

00:15:20.994 --> 00:15:24.454
Just do it! Kiritsubo will clean
up the mess after you!

00:15:25.234 --> 00:15:26.194
Me?!

00:15:26.194 --> 00:15:28.464
Chief, who is that?!

00:15:28.464 --> 00:15:29.904
Minamoto!

00:15:30.774 --> 00:15:34.224
I dunno what's going on, but we
just have to cut these, right?

00:15:34.944 --> 00:15:36.104
Kaoru, wait!

00:15:36.244 --> 00:15:40.904
Here we go! PSYCHIC TAPE CUT!

00:15:45.684 --> 00:15:48.424
We bring you this report of
evil espers on the rampage!

00:15:48.424 --> 00:15:50.784
The ones our government
has made special esper...

00:15:51.894 --> 00:15:52.754
A blackout?

00:16:03.134 --> 00:16:04.564
Uh-oh! The broadcast's been canceled!

00:16:08.004 --> 00:16:10.944
Found them! Sending location
to Supervisor Minamoto!

00:16:13.114 --> 00:16:16.044
Okay, Kaoru, reconnect those
power lines at once!

00:16:16.044 --> 00:16:18.054
Aoi and Shiho, capture the suspects!

00:16:18.054 --> 00:16:18.584
Roger!

00:16:18.584 --> 00:16:19.014
On it!

00:16:19.484 --> 00:16:20.884
Let's get out of here!

00:16:23.654 --> 00:16:25.784
Huh? Big brother, look!

00:16:29.024 --> 00:16:30.364
You're not getting away!

00:16:39.574 --> 00:16:43.374
How dare you sully our lovely image.

00:16:43.374 --> 00:16:45.104
You'll regret that till you die!

00:16:47.344 --> 00:16:48.174
Shit!

00:16:48.714 --> 00:16:50.234
Super Electro Spa...

00:16:50.584 --> 00:16:51.914
Don't resist!

00:16:51.914 --> 00:16:56.324
You're under arrest for misuse of
esper powers and broadcast violations!

00:16:56.954 --> 00:16:57.854
How naive.

00:16:57.854 --> 00:16:58.444
What?

00:16:59.054 --> 00:17:02.824
You can't catch us brothers unless
you get both at the same time!

00:17:04.634 --> 00:17:08.494
Big brother! I won't be beaten! I won't be beaten!

00:17:08.664 --> 00:17:11.464
Psychic Left Hand Rule!

00:17:13.574 --> 00:17:14.544
Don't move!

00:17:15.944 --> 00:17:17.414
What's going on?!

00:17:17.414 --> 00:17:18.674
What's wrong, Shiho?

00:17:19.174 --> 00:17:21.414
I can't get it off!

00:17:21.414 --> 00:17:22.074
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:17:22.284 --> 00:17:24.254
Steel cans... Magnetism?!

00:17:24.254 --> 00:17:25.414
Indeed.

00:17:26.354 --> 00:17:29.724
I just applied a magnetic coating to you!

00:17:29.724 --> 00:17:33.624
If you don't get away fast,
you'll be buried in nonburnable trash!

00:17:38.934 --> 00:17:40.224
Temporary teleport!

00:17:46.074 --> 00:17:48.764
And why don't you sample
my poison electrowave?

00:17:48.944 --> 00:17:50.204
Poison electro wave?

00:18:04.154 --> 00:18:05.624
That should do it.

00:18:06.864 --> 00:18:07.694
Where is everyone?

00:18:12.164 --> 00:18:13.224
Oh, there they are!

00:18:19.104 --> 00:18:20.234
Queen.

00:18:20.674 --> 00:18:21.834
Minamoto.

00:18:22.104 --> 00:18:23.094
Why, you!

00:18:23.844 --> 00:18:26.944
Agh! I can see time! It's coming!
Something's coming!

00:18:26.944 --> 00:18:31.144
IT'S THE LIGHT OF PURE HATRED!

00:18:32.754 --> 00:18:34.274
You broke Minamoto!

00:18:35.784 --> 00:18:38.824
Human thoughts are just electrical
signals within the brain.

00:18:38.824 --> 00:18:41.524
I'm just disrupting them a bit right now,

00:18:41.864 --> 00:18:45.764
But I could destroy his personality
completely if I wished.

00:18:46.764 --> 00:18:49.664
Stop! Don't do anything to Minamoto!

00:18:50.104 --> 00:18:53.774
That's up to you. If you wish to save him...

00:18:53.774 --> 00:18:55.634
Then you're coming with us!

00:18:56.814 --> 00:18:59.074
BABEL is surrounding us.

00:18:59.274 --> 00:19:02.214
But with you helping, escape
won't be difficult at all.

00:19:02.544 --> 00:19:05.954
Besides, I'm sure the major will be
pleased if we bring you back with us...

00:19:08.254 --> 00:19:10.274
Queen of Catastrophe.

00:19:10.594 --> 00:19:14.084
Goddess who shall lead us espers
to salvation in the future!

00:19:17.064 --> 00:19:18.994
If I go with you...

00:19:20.304 --> 00:19:22.064
you'll return Minamoto to normal, right?

00:19:22.504 --> 00:19:27.374
I promise, as a fellow esper.
No need for us to fight anymore.

00:19:28.004 --> 00:19:29.444
Um, big brother?

00:19:29.644 --> 00:19:30.164
What?

00:19:30.274 --> 00:19:31.144
L-Look!

00:19:31.844 --> 00:19:33.574
We heard everything!

00:19:33.714 --> 00:19:36.404
Yeah! And you're not getting either of them!

00:19:37.554 --> 00:19:39.274
Super Electro Spark!

00:19:40.684 --> 00:19:41.154
What?!

00:19:42.424 --> 00:19:46.054
Using this Gomzo BCS-DHV antenna to
concentrate your poison electro waves...

00:19:47.194 --> 00:19:49.124
Now go to shining space!

00:19:49.224 --> 00:19:50.324
This can't be happening!

00:19:50.564 --> 00:19:51.554
Now, Kaoru!

00:19:51.894 --> 00:19:52.454
Aoi!

00:19:53.534 --> 00:19:54.604
Psychic Left Hand...

00:19:54.604 --> 00:19:55.534
Too slow!

00:19:58.134 --> 00:20:00.434
You're going down, down, DOWN!

00:20:04.714 --> 00:20:06.944
Don't call me a fellow esper!

00:20:06.944 --> 00:20:09.844
We're not like you creeps in PANDRA!

00:20:10.284 --> 00:20:11.144
Kaoru...

00:20:11.614 --> 00:20:12.584
Kaoru...

00:20:14.284 --> 00:20:15.774
Minamoto!

00:20:16.624 --> 00:20:19.314
Minamoto, snap out of it! Hey!

00:20:21.894 --> 00:20:23.824
As a Virgo, I'm fine...

00:20:24.694 --> 00:20:25.694
Virgo?

00:20:25.694 --> 00:20:27.524
Looks like there are still some after effects.

00:20:27.704 --> 00:20:29.764
You have surprisingly weak
endurance, don't you?

00:20:29.764 --> 00:20:31.904
I'm not weak at enduring anything!

00:20:31.904 --> 00:20:33.564
Don't imply that I am!

00:20:34.904 --> 00:20:37.374
And so, I'd like to apologize...

00:20:37.374 --> 00:20:40.514
to anyone who was inconvenienced
by what we did.

00:20:40.514 --> 00:20:40.944
"Emergency Press Conference"
to anyone who was inconvenienced
by what we did.

00:20:40.944 --> 00:20:44.414
"Emergency Press Conference"
We broadcast false information to frame BABEL...

00:20:44.414 --> 00:20:45.754
"Emergency Press Conference"
Enough with that! Go on, already!

00:20:45.754 --> 00:20:46.544
Enough with that! Go on, already!

00:20:47.784 --> 00:20:51.554
The special espers The Children are... Um...

00:20:51.554 --> 00:20:53.384
They are actually like this!

00:20:53.724 --> 00:20:54.984
Okay!

00:20:56.964 --> 00:20:59.554
Let's go, everyone!

00:21:00.364 --> 00:21:03.164
Teku maku mahari ta-tari laa-ri-laaan!

00:21:04.034 --> 00:21:06.934
Let's bring happiness to everyone in the world!

00:21:07.304 --> 00:21:10.534
Special espers The Children!

00:21:13.074 --> 00:21:15.104
I definitely don't know them.

00:21:16.314 --> 00:21:17.854
Good work!

00:21:17.854 --> 00:21:19.574
Go on! Keep walking!

00:21:19.954 --> 00:21:23.184
Won't that broadcast now just
make a worse impression?

00:21:23.184 --> 00:21:25.094
Never mind that, Minamoto!

00:21:25.094 --> 00:21:28.584
How can you, as their commander, stand
in the way of The Childrens' success?!

00:21:28.794 --> 00:21:30.434
S-Sorry, sir!

00:21:30.434 --> 00:21:32.494
I wasn't prepared for an attack like that!

00:21:32.494 --> 00:21:34.464
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:21:34.464 --> 00:21:36.934
Minamoto's protected by us!

00:21:37.334 --> 00:21:38.594
Right, so just relax.

00:21:39.304 --> 00:21:40.394
Gee, thanks.

00:21:40.774 --> 00:21:42.864
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

00:21:43.274 --> 00:21:45.074
Oh, no! Where is she?!

00:21:45.514 --> 00:21:48.344
I need to start processing the
damages from that blackout!

00:21:48.344 --> 00:21:51.514
That's right. Who was that voice on the phone?

00:21:52.754 --> 00:21:56.954
You've raised some interesting
children, haven't you, Kiritsubo?

00:21:56.954 --> 00:22:00.394
Hyobu Kyosuke...
I won't let you get away with this.

00:22:03.324 --> 00:22:06.594
But for now, I'll withdraw.

00:22:21.414 --> 00:22:26.114
I embraced your boasting tight

00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:29.054
Even everything about your sad profile

00:22:29.054 --> 00:22:31.424
I love

00:22:31.424 --> 00:22:35.624
Girl who gets stronger with
every wall she breaks

00:22:35.624 --> 00:22:41.494
My eyes will never wander from you

00:22:41.834 --> 00:22:46.804
Because these too-honest feelings in my heart

00:22:46.804 --> 00:22:50.374
Can't be beaten by anyone

00:22:50.374 --> 00:22:53.514
I absolutely will never let you go,

00:22:53.514 --> 00:22:55.614
No matter when or why

00:22:55.614 --> 00:23:00.824
And I'll change that still-unseen last scene

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.154
Devils and angels both have wings

00:23:05.154 --> 00:23:10.794
So let's aim for higher skies

00:23:10.794 --> 00:23:15.504
Don't let your smile be clouded anymore

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:18.104
When the hopes that connect us now

00:23:18.104 --> 00:23:21.874
Rip the darkness apart

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Together, you and I

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.674
Will fly towards the future, Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.624 --> 00:23:41.864
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.864 --> 00:23:41.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:44.154
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:44.364 --> 00:23:47.734
Darn it, Minamoto said he had an
important duty today, but...

00:23:47.734 --> 00:23:48.634
Wanna go spy on him?

00:23:48.634 --> 00:23:51.774
We can't! He said we were to
absolutely stay away from him!

00:23:51.774 --> 00:23:53.864
Saying no just makes you
even more curious, right?

00:23:53.944 --> 00:23:54.924
Exactly!

00:23:55.074 --> 00:23:56.594
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:56.674 --> 00:23:59.874
Episode 28: "A Lady's Special Charms!
Tsubomi Kiss Alert"

00:24:00.044 --> 00:24:03.844
Oh, hello! I know all about you girls!

00:24:03.914 --> 00:24:05.504
Let's all be friends!

00:24:05.584 --> 00:24:06.684
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.684 --> 00:24:07.584
A Lady's Special Charms!
Tsubomi Kiss Alert
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

